# City bus (R23 vehicle, parked): a long ink-blue bus with a ribbon of windows, a few dimly lit, and a cyan route
# board over the windscreen. Hollow body. Faces +x.
grid 5
size 220 48 62
slot body InkBlue
slot glass WindowOff
slot lit WindowDim
slot trim Trim
slot board NeonCyan
slot wheel Rubble
shell 2 2 6 218 46 60 2 body
box 10 2 30 206 3 46 glass
box 10 45 30 206 46 46 glass
paint box 40 2 31 64 3 45 lit
paint box 110 45 31 140 46 45 lit
paint box 160 2 31 176 3 45 lit
box 217 6 22 218 42 50 glass
box 216 10 51 218 38 56 board
paint box 2 2 28 218 46 29 trim
paint box 2 2 47 218 46 48 trim
carve box 180 45 8 194 46 46
box 180 44 8 194 45 46 glass
ellipsoid 30 3 7 8 3 7 wheel
ellipsoid 30 45 7 8 3 7 wheel
ellipsoid 180 3 7 8 3 7 wheel
ellipsoid 180 45 7 8 3 7 wheel
